|blurb        = {{sbc|Innate:}} {{ci|Azir}} periodically can summon the {{as|Disc of the Sun|buzzword2}} from the ruins of allied or enemy {{tip|turret|turrets}}.
|blurb2       = {{as|Disc of the Sun|buzzword2}} functions as a turret that decays over time, and weakens when '''Azir''' leaves it.
|description  = {{sbc|Innate:}} Whenever a {{tip|turret}} outside the enemy team's base is destroyed, a marker is placed above its ruins which can be targeted by '''Azir'''.
|icon2        = Shurima's Legacy.png
|description2 = {{sbc|Innate - Disc of the Sun:}} '''Azir''' can select a marker to construct the {{as|Sun Disc|buzzword2}} above the ruins after a {{fd|0.5}}-second [[cast time]]. The {{as|Sun Disc|buzzword2}} will activate after being assembled over 5 seconds.<br><br>'''''Azir''' cannot construct a {{as|Sun Disc|buzzword2}} with the marker while he is affected by {{tip|cast-inhibiting crowd control}} or a {{tip|lockout}} that disables abilities.''
|description3 = The {{as|Sun Disc|buzzword2}} functions the same as a standard [[Turret#Inner_turret|inner turret]] but deals {{as|magic damage}}, gains {{as|40% AP}} {{sti|{{as|'''bonus''' attack damage}}}}, and grants its kill credit to '''Azir'''. The {{as|Sun Disc's|buzzword2}} {{sti|{{as|health}}}} decays over 45 seconds and loses {{sti|armor|{{as|100 armor}}}} and {{sti|magic resistance|{{as|100 magic resistance}}}} while '''Azir''' is not alive or is too far away.
|description4 = ''See [[Azir#Pets|Pets]] for more details about the {{as|Sun Disc|buzzword2}}.''
